Worker body presets in this folder (anny_*.json) were measured from the Anny human body model.

Anny (NAVER LABS Europe), https://github.com/naver/anny
  Code: Copyright (C) 2025 NAVER Corp., Apache License 2.0.
  Mesh, blend shapes, rig and skinning weights: derived from MakeHuman / MPFB2 assets, CC0 1.0 Universal.
  Citation: Bregier et al., "Human Mesh Modeling for Anny Body", ECCV 2026 (arXiv:2511.03589).

Spinous-level heights (S1/L3/T10/T2) were mapped from BodyParts3D, (c) The Database Center for
Life Science (DBCLS), licensed under CC BY 4.0.

Segment mass fractions for comparison: de Leva P. (1996), "Adjustments to Zatsiorsky-Seluyanov's
segment inertia parameters", J Biomech 29(9):1223-1230.

Anny's phenotype parameters encode MakeHuman artists' body templates, not real identity traits.
These presets are illustrative bodies, not measurements of any worker.
